<body>
    <h1>Business Requirements &amp; Tracking</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 local-id=3D"83537da7f7f5" id=3D"BusinessRequirements&amp;Tracki=
ng-ProxyIQ-BusinessRequirements&amp;Tracking">ProxyIQ - Business Requiremen=
ts &amp; Tracking</h1>
<p local-id=3D"69e377f6c896">Last Updated: March 13, 2026</p>
<hr local-id=3D"b780385e68d4">
<h2 local-id=3D"2a98026e9ac9" id=3D"BusinessRequirements&amp;Tracking-=F0=
=9F=8E=AFHowtoUseThisPage">=F0=9F=8E=AF How to Use This Page</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"41e52d6daeae">
<li local-id=3D"6213e41ebc14">
<p local-id=3D"eff918171e13">Each requirement below links to Jira tickets</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"984d7683f836">
<p local-id=3D"45c0efc86108">Status updates automatically from Jira</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"208238d1f2a2">
<p local-id=3D"437ee6c4818b">Click ticket numbers to view full details</p><=
/li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"06824059fcc6">
<h2 local-id=3D"14ef6ba6403e" id=3D"BusinessRequirements&amp;Tracking-Proxy=
IQScalabilityEnhancement">ProxyIQ Scalability Enhancement</h2>
<p local-id=3D"580df25abf6c"><strong>Business Need:</strong> Improve ProxyI=
Q platform scalability for high-volume HL7/FHIR data ingestion and multi-te=
nant operations</p>
<p local-id=3D"3328d254c050"><strong>Expected Outcome:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"95e9a17322c2">
<li local-id=3D"3f6fe29c6667">
<p local-id=3D"88a797b4f8b9">Handle increased data volume without performan=
ce degradation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c8ec2c5b59d9">
<p local-id=3D"c98604c5d78f">Support multiple tenants with isolated data sc=
hemas</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d968dd05f0d8">
<p local-id=3D"e675711b568f">Optimize HL7/FHIR message processing</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"e49927a73e96"><strong>What We're Building:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b289af189b76">
<li local-id=3D"031d1a3dceb2">
<p local-id=3D"ece541517e82">Schema segregation for multi-tenant architectu=
re</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5b7444e34787">
<p local-id=3D"87b0b98fe811">HL7/FHIR data processing optimization</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f764146c9d13">
<p local-id=3D"79bc39d49f3a">Performance improvements for high-volume opera=
tions</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"5b12a7873c1e"><strong>Related Jira Tickets:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"0817e8bfe6c8">
<li local-id=3D"33ac3008860d">
<p local-id=3D"37de4b1d76fe"><span class=3D"confluence-jim-macro jira-issue=
" data-jira-key=3D"NKP-9"> <a href=3D"https://medzah-team.atlassian.net/bro=
wse/NKP-9" class=3D"jira-issue-key"><img class=3D"icon" src=3D"https://medz=
ah-team.atlassian.net/images/icons/issuetypes/epic.svg">NKP-9</a> - <span c=
lass=3D"summary">ProxyIQ scalability (schema segregation) + daily HL7/FHIR =
ingest + manual ops flow</span> <span class=3D"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subt=
le aui-lozenge-current jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf">In Progress</spa=
n> </span></p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"ab60bc71342f"></p>
<hr local-id=3D"bfb7f2ec0372">
<h2 local-id=3D"d3dab3b1d459" id=3D"BusinessRequirements&amp;Tracking-MakeA=
ssessmentSectionEditable">Make Assessment Section Editable</h2>
<p local-id=3D"c94550762cb6"><strong>Business Need:</strong> Vendors need a=
bility to scan items and modify assessment section after initial confirmati=
on, just like the Delivery section</p>
<p local-id=3D"4ef467b11b7e"><strong>Current State:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"bbebe34430b2">
<li local-id=3D"9db474e1def3">
<p local-id=3D"4ec387a224f1">Detail of product ordered populates in Assessm=
ent</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eb4efe9af8d1">
<p local-id=3D"66a0970ee237">Can modify to add other items</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"598e97ae5d82">
<p local-id=3D"008d53763a87">Once confirmed, can't return to this section</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c80d1ba02d32">
<p local-id=3D"b47b986af1b8">Can't download encounter at this point</p></li=
>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"bca137d3ea1a"><strong>Expected Outcome:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b1ed84f92b15">
<li local-id=3D"89db1ad42095">
<p local-id=3D"4664234ccad5">Assessment section works like Delivery section=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"59a78f37f722">
<p local-id=3D"6af72abb74f7">Vendors can scan items and modify after confir=
mation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b3099d1d7d0d">
<p local-id=3D"37d3d0291d8c">Full flexibility to add/edit/delete items</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"c743884ad957">
<p local-id=3D"16ae2454eb03">Download encounter from Assessment section</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"c856775b29fc"><strong>What We're Building:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"579af592a7e4">
<li local-id=3D"11fc327013d6">
<p local-id=3D"41323323e6be">Scanning capability in Assessment (like Delive=
ry section)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"48b9c9d11338">
<p local-id=3D"81055cd46f4a">Tabs for Lot and Non-Lot items</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"440736f0b894">
<p local-id=3D"51ccd262efac">Non-Lot items support bundles (1 HCPCS entered=
 =E2=86=92 auto-populates 5 items)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"658aa45df23d">
<p local-id=3D"28a5c8879e25">Ability to add/delete line items</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b48c544f9518">
<p local-id=3D"87b7515796c6">Return to section to modify after confirmation=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a717163b5228">
<p local-id=3D"b5c7d1f88644">Timestamp first confirmation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5fe254c3581b">
<p local-id=3D"d201282902f5">Track all edits with audit trail</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6ef686bc32ef">
<p local-id=3D"c17370907cb7">Download encounter from Assessment section</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"c73665865952"><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"deeb140ab2eb">
<li local-id=3D"886ad0fa34d7">
<p local-id=3D"827b2b2d25a0">[ ] Can scan items in Assessment section</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"fdb1930d5d53">
<p local-id=3D"e5b957425ded">[ ] Lot and Non-Lot tabs functional</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ee2b3e07d94f">
<p local-id=3D"0851b5eab255">[ ] Bundle auto-population works for Non-Lot i=
tems</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7b6f47e23057">
<p local-id=3D"4ed3b2483d40">[ ] Add/delete line items works</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b1f17a250ba1">
<p local-id=3D"a990095640e5">[ ] Can return to edit after first confirmatio=
n</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e49c95e99629">
<p local-id=3D"f292ade3562f">[ ] First confirmation timestamped</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"95dd1c6329cd">
<p local-id=3D"f3c0a624260b">[ ] Edit history tracked</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4a69dafbe645">
<p local-id=3D"6fcb14865fd9">[ ] Encounter download available from Assessme=
nt</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"10b68ffad1da"><strong>Related Jira Tickets:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"3ad9b8528551">
<li local-id=3D"a30323bdb704">
<p local-id=3D"279a116ded0d"><span class=3D"confluence-jim-macro jira-issue=
" data-jira-key=3D"NKP-20"> <a href=3D"https://medzah-team.atlassian.net/br=
owse/NKP-20" class=3D"jira-issue-key"><img class=3D"icon" src=3D"https://me=
dzah-team.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/ava=
tar/10300?size=3Dmedium">NKP-20</a> - <span class=3D"summary">Assessment Se=
ction: Make Assessment Section Editable</span> <span class=3D"aui-lozenge a=
ui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-complete jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf">=
Selected for Development</span> </span></p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"17b5ba738397"></p>
<hr local-id=3D"287569fd6cdb">
<h2 local-id=3D"e088efbefe09" id=3D"BusinessRequirements&amp;Tracking-Updat=
eDeliverySectiontoMatchAssessment">Update Delivery Section to Match Assessm=
ent</h2>
<p local-id=3D"97d9f440c312"><strong>Business Need:</strong> Delivery secti=
on needs same updated functionality as Assessment section for consistency</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"0acd07f44951"><strong>Current State:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"32631a47bdc7">
<li local-id=3D"c9eafd40b04a">
<p local-id=3D"c45fdfa13f58">Lot items are scanned or manually entered (pul=
ls from inventory database)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3f6cdd588eeb">
<p local-id=3D"2fcbfa22f60f">Once lot item is scanned, assigns HCPCS and Me=
dicare fee</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b70b71b0b6e5">
<p local-id=3D"0c4717074235">No ability to enter Non-Lot items (HCPCS only)=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"80dc0db02424">
<p local-id=3D"553891af8a36">Can add items via plus sign</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d3ab0292cc79"><strong>Expected Outcome:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"0c1277b6c934">
<li local-id=3D"3ac5cfec7c3a">
<p local-id=3D"2a5b763816e0">Delivery section has same capabilities as upda=
ted Assessment section</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5be95c4d1fc9">
<p local-id=3D"9fc73ca4f1f0">Consistent user experience between both sectio=
ns</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"b85c124a251f"><strong>What We're Building:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"e793ff51b6c4">
<li local-id=3D"9de2b55cc138">
<p local-id=3D"90dbcbd9edc9">Lot and Non-Lot sections (matching Assessment)=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"35d3f6fb5684">
<p local-id=3D"8c0c5c95fb8e">Ability to add/delete line items in both secti=
ons</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"70f68a4c61c0">
<p local-id=3D"c154231b9a68">Consistent UX and functionality</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"fb75ea0a3bb0"><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"82b36d2abe4d">
<li local-id=3D"c405aa66e8a3">
<p local-id=3D"ff0a8641bfc7">[ ] Lot and Non-Lot sections both present</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"452f00f34cb2">
<p local-id=3D"210517a2d838">[ ] Add/delete works for both item types</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"7aecf0798e4f">
<p local-id=3D"fd31303ecea9">[ ] UX matches Assessment section</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c6dfa236f07c">
<p local-id=3D"d53e332b75a8">[ ] All functionality consistent between secti=
ons</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"2491cac0b48b"><strong>Related Jira Tickets:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"90228aff08d0">
<li local-id=3D"3907531f54a6">
<p local-id=3D"098ac237af9c"><span class=3D"confluence-jim-macro jira-issue=
" data-jira-key=3D"NKP-21"> <a href=3D"https://medzah-team.atlassian.net/br=
owse/NKP-21" class=3D"jira-issue-key"><img class=3D"icon" src=3D"https://me=
dzah-team.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/ava=
tar/10300?size=3Dmedium">NKP-21</a> - <span class=3D"summary">Delivery Sect=
ion: Update Delivery Section to match Assessment Section</span> <span class=
=3D"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-complete jira-macro-single-i=
ssue-export-pdf">Selected for Development</span> </span></p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"c11ad5724a9c">
<h2 local-id=3D"4a9552bdf8ce" id=3D"BusinessRequirements&amp;Tracking-AddNe=
wInventoryItemModal">Add New Inventory Item Modal</h2>
<p local-id=3D"bcf75e3e12ee"><strong>Business Need:</strong> Users need abi=
lity to add new inventory items without leaving their current workflow</p>
<p local-id=3D"b1455d9974fd"><strong>Expected Outcome:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"f8d96985f279">
<li local-id=3D"02a98b98f780">
<p local-id=3D"ae456dcdc8d9">Quick way to add inventory items inline</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"a0c9ecedc9d0">
<p local-id=3D"d7322cdec344">Support for both Lot and Non-Lot items</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"e55d2614fd5f">
<p local-id=3D"8eeedee5869f">Saves directly to inventory database</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"52b13b6a1594"><strong>What We're Building:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"58ec00141eb2">
<li local-id=3D"808e555d84cc">
<p local-id=3D"6e33d09a0917">"Add New Item" button in inventory management<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8c845a5c8df6">
<p local-id=3D"63fb792c5b81">Modal window opens on click</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3115791fed7e">
<p local-id=3D"c1a1771a25c8">Form to add either Lot or Non-Lot items</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"a6c54ef49b7f">
<p local-id=3D"23f6d04454d8">Saves to inventory database</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"78d290aeae0c">
<p local-id=3D"b2b66cc2a26d">Modal closes, new item immediately available</=
p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"153670e4560c"><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"58ac49c4c5f1">
<li local-id=3D"a13a922b7b15">
<p local-id=3D"301a161963ae">[ ] "Add New Item" button visible and function=
al</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a22e3a7cd6b8">
<p local-id=3D"9a7a37f55468">[ ] Modal opens with form fields</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4c861c9151a8">
<p local-id=3D"43dc32464dd4">[ ] Can select Lot or Non-Lot item type</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"0f03bb9c402d">
<p local-id=3D"253ef3f0cf14">[ ] All required fields present</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"600e1c2a5f20">
<p local-id=3D"fd1f9619494a">[ ] Saves to inventory database</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c88c3fdacc7d">
<p local-id=3D"dfb5aeca3251">[ ] New item immediately available in dropdown=
s</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"978327946d3a">
<p local-id=3D"e7362f5e9d36">[ ] Modal closes after successful save</p></li=
>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"78b3529cf700"><strong>Related Jira Tickets:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"457feef158fe">
<li local-id=3D"720e2f80426e">
<p local-id=3D"c0e909fc6bf8"><span class=3D"confluence-jim-macro jira-issue=
" data-jira-key=3D"NKP-19"> <a href=3D"https://medzah-team.atlassian.net/br=
owse/NKP-19" class=3D"jira-issue-key"><img class=3D"icon" src=3D"https://me=
dzah-team.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/ava=
tar/10300?size=3Dmedium">NKP-19</a> - <span class=3D"summary">Create Add ne=
w items modal Inventory Screen</span> <span class=3D"aui-lozenge aui-lozeng=
e-subtle aui-lozenge-complete jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf">Selected =
for Development</span> </span></p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"00146583a521">
<h2 local-id=3D"fe912122643b" id=3D"BusinessRequirements&amp;Tracking-Datab=
aseIsolationImplementation">Database Isolation Implementation</h2>
<p local-id=3D"6dcd52fe6ad7"><strong>Business Need:</strong> Ensure data is=
olation between different hospital networks for security, compliance, and p=
erformance</p>
<p local-id=3D"8cfe1f941338"><strong>Current State:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"a3842f40e1a6">
<li local-id=3D"3955549f117f">
<p local-id=3D"9c34d157c31b">Single database schema shared across all clien=
ts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"23899bfacf4c">
<p local-id=3D"6e3231c994aa">Potential data leakage risk between providers<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d704834cff65">
<p local-id=3D"520fb3650cc9">Performance degradation as data volume grows</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ba2e6cf55a2d">
<p local-id=3D"5dd75f1bd333">Difficult to provide per-tenant SLAs</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"a0a0fd36c8d9"><strong>Expected Outcome:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"782f4cd00bc0">
<li local-id=3D"0bcb9e9690fa">
<p local-id=3D"25f62a928cfb">Each provider has isolated data in separate sc=
hema/partition</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ff2169606975">
<p local-id=3D"6c8e73d85942">No cross-tenant data access possible</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c470c19bdef4">
<p local-id=3D"0c41225b87bb">Improved query performance with smaller data s=
ets per tenant</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bbcd4a58bedc">
<p local-id=3D"b7bce2b31dc7">Ability to offer provider-specific SLAs</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"4555c1d3eaa0">
<p local-id=3D"8c55e11943d7">Easier compliance auditing (HIPAA per-tenant)<=
/p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"f42b71ebcaf2"><strong>What We're Building:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"dfe3fb98f9f5">
<li local-id=3D"da194fea1976">
<p local-id=3D"8072a724d552">Multi-tenant database architecture with schema=
 segregation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7e0c5ad3cefd">
<p local-id=3D"6c5b5cbc275c">Tenant-specific data partitioning in DynamoDB<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"86f6247ccf43">
<p local-id=3D"b8286b322ad8">Row-level security enforcement</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dd157d58856d">
<p local-id=3D"e4b07b6d3da3">Tenant context validation in all API calls</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"bf30b1dceec5">
<p local-id=3D"b4ed69f5355a">Data migration scripts to move existing data i=
nto isolated schemas</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a7017fcaa5dd">
<p local-id=3D"9ca75d3cb740">Admin tools to manage tenant schemas</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"ead993c42a5a"><strong>Technical Approach:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"7d37245ed9fd">
<li local-id=3D"c2d0b0c29a1c">
<p local-id=3D"179dbbfab62a">Implement tenant ID prefix in DynamoDB partiti=
on keys</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5e8fd8ee0abb">
<p local-id=3D"d73a46f405e7">Lambda authorizer validates tenant context on =
every request</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f1546805392c">
<p local-id=3D"72041f918f91">Cognito user pools include tenant metadata</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"42284c44bb0e">
<p local-id=3D"2403a1c415e5">GraphQL resolvers filter by tenant ID automati=
cally</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fb74a548aec4">
<p local-id=3D"4b963080241e">Separate S3 prefixes per tenant for file stora=
ge</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"251d006fce30"><strong>Acceptance Criteria:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"bc39d46fd832">
<li local-id=3D"654ccbc1d3ae">
<p local-id=3D"b6431fffc57e">[ ] Each provider has isolated database schema=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cfebe3c010ab">
<p local-id=3D"750b655f71b5">[ ] No cross-tenant queries possible (enforced=
 at code level)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c1bc541ed64c">
<p local-id=3D"09b5231b7a50">[ ] Tenant ID automatically injected into all =
queries</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0d0e1dc4fa60">
<p local-id=3D"964d03789354">[ ] Data migration completed for existing tena=
nts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3e3a896dd0a6">
<p local-id=3D"6d628122f32f">[ ] Performance benchmarks show improved query=
 times</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5405713f271c">
<p local-id=3D"f982d5089e53">[ ] Security audit confirms zero cross-tenant =
access</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d22a03d42937">
<p local-id=3D"10fdd0c87242">[ ] Admin dashboard shows per-tenant data stat=
istics</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d710d9d601a8">
<p local-id=3D"20568decb1f5">[ ] Rollback plan documented and tested</p></l=
i>
</ul>
